WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,890 --> 00:00:03,690
You go first, I'll wait for you here

2
00:00:04,090 --> 00:00:06,490
There are still twenty minutes left in class and I won’t delay you.

3
00:00:06,690 --> 00:00:07,650
My sister Xia also has classes

4
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:14,020
My name is Meng Hanyu

5
00:00:14,340 --> 00:00:15,860
I guess he's your cousin

6
00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:17,500
Your cousin is Su Linyun

7
00:00:18,820 --> 00:00:19,860
All are

8
00:00:21,090 --> 00:00:24,440
Have we met before somewhere?

9
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:28,940
Xizhou Yunwu Mountain continues

10
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:30,420
I fainted

11
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:32,980
But if I woke up once in the middle, it shouldn't be a dream

12
00:00:34,740 --> 00:00:37,700
I have memorized that back figure for three months and I will never admit that it is you.

13
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:39,740
The last person who took this was someone who threatened me.

14
00:00:40,220 --> 00:00:42,220
I'm already in the hospital, so what?

15
00:00:42,620 --> 00:00:47,940
I don't mean anything else, I just want to thank you. If it weren't for you, we wouldn't be able to get out. You took the seventh test of the college entrance examination.

16
00:00:48,140 --> 00:00:49,980
It’s also to save us, right? Are you done?

17
00:00:50,540 --> 00:00:51,740
Have you signed a confidentiality agreement?

18
00:00:52,220 --> 00:00:55,460
I haven't told anyone and my parents don't have it, so that's fine
